{
  "catalog": "chat-templates",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Structured chat messages both sides may send. Data, not a schema: render with render_chat_message (Python) / renderChatMessage (TypeScript). A receiver re-renders a structured chat.message and rejects it if the body differs.",
